Another name of se.ra.yah (שְׂרָיָהוּ "Seraiah" H8304G) 
§ Shisha = "Jehovah contends"
1) father of Elihoreph and Ahiah, the royal secretaries in the reign of Solomon
1a) apparently the same as 'Shavsha' who held the same position under David

H5838H.d:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ki.4.5; 
son of: Nathan (H5416H); 
brother of: Zabud (H2071)
§ Azariah = "Jehovah has helped"
1) son of king Amaziah of Judah and king of Judah himself for 52 years; also 'Uzziah' …

H2071.d:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ki.4.5; 
son of: Nathan (H5416H); 
brother of: Azariah (H5838H) 
§ Zabud = "given"
a priest, son of Nathan, who held the post of 'king's friend' to Solomon

H0141.d:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.20.24; 
son of: Abda (H5653); also called Adoniram at 1Ki.4.6; 5.14; Hadoram at 2Ch.10.18; 
Another name of a.do.ram (אֲדֹרָם "Adoram" H0151) 
§ Adoniram = "my lord is exalted"
one of Solomon's officers

H2955.d:
A woman of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ki.4.11; 
daughter of: Solomon (H8010); 
sister of: Basemath (H1315) and Rehoboam (H7346); married to Ben-abinadab (H1125) 
§ Taphath = "ornament"
the daughter of Solomon who was married to Ben-Abinadab

H1315G.d:
A woman of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ki.4.15; 
daughter of: Solomon (H8010); 
sister of: Taphath (H2955) and Rehoboam (H7346); married to Ahimaaz (H0290I)
§ Bashemath or Basmath = "spice"
1) Hittite wife of Esau, daughter of Ishmael, sister of Nebaioth
2) daughter of Solomon, wife of Ahimaaz, one of Solomon's commissariat officers

H3633G.d:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ki.4.31; 
son of: Mahol (H4235); 
brother of: Ethan (H0387), Heman (H1968) and Darda (H1862)
§ Calcol or Chalcol = "sustaining"
son or descendant of Zerah of Judah and one of the wise men with whom Solomon was compared

H1862.d:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ki.4.31; 
son of: Mahol (H4235); 
brother of: Ethan (H0387), Heman (H1968) and Calcol (H3633) 
§ Darda = "pearl of knowledge"
a son of Mahol, one of four men of great fame for their wisdom, but surpassed by Solomon

H3379G.d:
A king of the Kingdom of Israel, living at the time of United Monarchyand Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ki.11.26; 
son of: Nebat (H5028) and Zeruah (H6871); 
father of: Abijah (H0029H), Nadab (H5070H)
§ Jeroboam = "the people will contend"
1) the first king of the northern kingdom of Israel when the kingdom split at the death of Solomon and the 10 tribes split off from Judah and Benjamin and the kingdom under Solomon's son Rehoboam; idolatry was introduced at the beginning of his reign …

H7346.d:
A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchyand Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ki.11.43; 
son of: Solomon (H8010) and Naamah (H5279A); 
brother of: Taphath (H2955) and Basemath (H1315); married to Maacah (H4601K), Mahalath (H4258H) and Abihail (H0032J); 
